<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Explore-on-Graph: Incentivizing Autonomous Exploration of Large Language Models on Knowledge Graphs with Path-refined Reward Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Complete Case Studies: Reasoning Paths and Model Outputs</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Explore-on-Graph: Incentivizing Autonomous Exploration of Large Language Models on Knowledge Graphs with Path-refined Reward Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>The Use of Large Language Models</span></a></li>
