<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Explore-on-Graph: Incentivizing Autonomous Exploration of Large Language Models on Knowledge Graphs with Path-refined Reward Modeling</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_thead">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="id1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Shiqi Yan<sup id="id1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,2</span></sup>, Yubo Chen<sup id="id1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>, Ruiqi Zhou<sup id="id1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2</span></sup>, Zhengxi Yao<sup id="id1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">2</span></sup>, Shuai Chen<sup id="id1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">4</span></sup>, Tianyi Zhang<sup id="id1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">4</span></sup>,</span></span></span>
<span id="id1.2" class="ltx_tr">
