</section>
<section id="S4.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.6 </span>Analysis of Exploration Behavior</h3>

<div id="S4.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To examine how reward design influences exploration behavior, we evaluate models using exploration efficiency and coverage of the reasoning space on the CWQ test set.
Exploration efficiency measures the average number
of explored triples required to identify one correct reasoning triple,
while reasoning coverage quantifies the proportion of ground-truth reasoning triples
successfully discovered. Detailed metric definitions are provided in Appendix <a href="#A16" title="Appendix P Detailed Definition of Exploration Metrics ‣ Explore-on-Graph: Incentivizing Autonomous Exploration of Large Language Models on Knowledge Graphs with Path-refined Reward Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">P</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Comparison of exploration efficiency and reasoning coverage on the CWQ test set.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></th>
<th id="S4.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Exploration Efficiency (<math id="S4.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></th>
<th id="S4.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Coverage (<math id="S4.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></th></tr>
